& [Need]
  + published planning identifies later duties but leaves the operator decision object and reserved ref unresolved
  + general development continuation cannot safely substitute for consent to create persistent Git and filesystem state

& [Choice]
  + form one proposal-only compiler before any live observer authorization or physical runner
  + bind exact identities coordinates ceilings gaps and quarantine consequences in deterministic machine forms
  + keep operator authorization fresh observation private permit and execution as later independent gates

& [Benefit]
  + operator can approve reject or revise one exact digest rather than an informal description
  + fixtures can prove responsibility accounting and refusal without touching external state

& [NonChoice]
  + no commission issuance signature generation authentication process Git filesystem provider persistence activation or cleanup implementation
